{
  "description": "A stored request record of schema <= 9 (one `region`) and the `windows` schema 10 reads it as. Python: stored_record_windows; Web: promoteCanonicalRenderRequestToCurrent (storedRegionWindows). `promotedSelector` is the selector the Web promotion leaves on the record (Python's decode reads the region selector into the region itself). OV-2957. A record with a selector on itself and in its region has no reading: both sides refuse it (`refused`; OV-3000, D-99).",
